# Edexcel IAL Biology — Core Practicals

## Specification: 2018

Pearson Edexcel International Advanced Level Biology
contains 18 core practical activities.

- IAS: Core Practicals 1–9
- IA2: Core Practicals 10–18

Practical skills are assessed through written examinations:
- WBI13/01 — Practical Skills in Biology I
- WBI16/01 — Practical Skills in Biology II

Students must also apply practical knowledge to unfamiliar
experimental situations.

The procedures below are revision examples aligned with
the official practical objectives, not mandatory official
step-by-step protocols.

---

